Use in ZeroJ
------------

The script is the reference that ZeroJ's Poseidon round constants and MDS matrices are checked
against (see README.md here and ADR-0015). It is not executed by ZeroJ code.

This directory is in src/main/resources of zeroj-circuit-lib, so both files ship in the published
zeroj-circuit-lib jar, together with this NOTICE, which carries the copyright and permission
notice that the MIT licence requires. The root NOTICE lists this material.
